@PaymentService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5127
@paymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@appointmentId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Listar pagamentos
GET {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Accept: application/json

###

### Criar pagamento
POST {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "{{appointmentId}}",
  "amount": 150.00
}

###

### Consultar pagamento
GET {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Atualizar status
PATCH {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Paid"
}

###

### Recusar pagamento (publica PaymentFailed com o motivo)
PATCH {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Failed",
  "reason": "Cartão recusado pela operadora"
}

###

### Consultar pagamento inexistente
GET {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Criar pagamento inválido
POST {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "amount": 0
}
